From: r-chong <dev.reese.chong@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:19:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat(models-torch): add Muse Glimmer PyTorch reference
 runner

Checkpoint-shaped text decoder (sliding/NoPE layers, gated GQA, centered norms,
softcapped logits) with request-owned state, a native vision tower, and an
Engine Runner. Eager, unpaged, no CUDA graphs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
